msgid ""
"%1$d lodging plan has a check-in time later than the latest check-in time "
"(%2$s), so the latest check-in time is not used for it."
msgid_plural ""
"%1$d lodging plans have a check-in time later than the latest check-in time "
"(%2$s), so the latest check-in time is not used for them."
msgstr[0] ""
"チェックイン時刻が最終チェックイン時刻（%2$s）より遅いため、最終チェックイン"
"時刻が使われない宿泊プランが %1$d 件あります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:727
msgid "Set the latest check-in time on the edit screen of each plan."
msgstr "各プランの編集画面で最終チェックイン時刻を設定してください。"

