#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1146
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1149
msgid "Industry preset"
msgstr "業種プリセット"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1157
msgid "Industry presets are available in the Pro edition."
msgstr "業種プリセットは Pro 版でご利用いただけます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1168
msgid ""
"When you select an industry, only the items commonly used in that industry "
"are displayed, with representative values entered in advance."
msgstr ""
"業種を選ぶと、その業種でよく使う項目だけが表示され、代表的な値があらかじめ入"
"力されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1168
msgid ""
"Other items are configured automatically in \"System settings\" and "
"\"Notation settings\"."
msgstr "それ以外の項目は「システム設定」と「表記設定」で自動的に設定されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1168
msgid ""
"Save the industry preset to apply the changes to \"System settings\" and "
"\"Notation settings\"."
msgstr ""
"業種プリセットを保存すると、「システム設定」と「表記設定」に変更が反映されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1169
msgid "Select \"Custom\" to configure all items individually (initial state)."
msgstr "「カスタム」を選ぶと、すべての項目を個別に設定できます（初期状態）。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1170
msgid ""
"If you select \"Lodging\", you can create plans by the night in service "
"menus, and customers choose a check-in date, check-out date, and room on the "
"reservation screen."
msgstr ""
"「宿泊」を選ぶと、サービスメニューで泊単位のプランを作成でき、予約画面では"
"チェックイン日・チェックアウト日と客室を選ぶ流れになります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1171
msgid ""
"If you switch from \"Lodging\" to another industry, plans set by the night "
"are handled as time slot plans."
msgstr ""
"「宿泊」から別の業種へ戻すと、泊単位に設定していたプランは時間枠のプランとし"
"て扱われます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1171
msgid ""
"Days that were set as sale days in \"Lodging\" have no time slots, so no "
"vacancies appear for time slot plans until you set the time slots in the "
"shift of each month."
msgstr ""
"「宿泊」で販売日にしていた日は時間帯が空のため、各月のシフトで時間帯を設定し"
"直すまで、時間枠のプランに空きは表示されません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1176
msgid ""
"These items are automatically saved with these values and cannot be changed "
"individually in \"System settings\" or \"Notation settings\"."
msgstr ""
"これらの項目は保存時にこの内容で自動的に登録され、「システム設定」と「表記設"
"定」では個別に変更できません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1176
msgid "Select \"Custom\" to configure them individually."
msgstr "個別に設定したい場合は「カスタム」を選んでください。"

