msgid ""
"Customers can proceed to the reservation screen without leaving the "
"reservation page."
msgstr "お客様は予約ページから移動せずに、予約画面へ進めます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1766
msgid "The reservation page must be set."
msgstr "予約ページの設定が必要です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1770
msgid ""
"The detail page of a service menu is displayed as an individual post of "
"WordPress."
msgstr "サービスメニューの詳細ページを、WordPressの個別投稿として表示します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1771
msgid "The appearance depends on the post template of your theme."
msgstr "見た目は、テーマの投稿テンプレートによって決まります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1774
msgid ""
"If \"Use\" is turned off for \"Details page\" of a service menu, the detail "
"page of that service menu is not displayed in either method."
msgstr ""
"サービスメニューの「詳細ページ」で「使用する」をオフにしている場合は、どちら"
"の方式でもそのサービスメニューの詳細ページは表示されません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1778
msgid "Please select a published page of this site as the reservation page."
msgstr "このサイトの公開中の固定ページを予約ページに選んでください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1779
msgid ""
"Until then, service menus are displayed as individual posts of WordPress "
"even if \"Display within the reservation block\" is selected."
msgstr ""
"設定するまでは、「予約ブロック内で表示」を選んでいても、サービスメニューは"
"WordPressの個別投稿として表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1780
#: src/common/class-reservation-page-url.php:243
msgid "Set the reservation page"
msgstr "予約ページを設定する"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1790
msgid "Currency symbol"
msgstr "通貨記号"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1801
msgid ""
"Enter the currency symbol to display with prices (e.g., $, ¥, €). If left "
"empty, the default symbol based on the site language will be used."
msgstr ""
"価格とともに表示する通貨記号（例：$、¥、€）を入力してください。空欄のままにし"
"た場合は、サイトの言語に基づいたデフォルトの通貨記号が使用されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1809
msgid "Tax label text"
msgstr "税込み表記テキスト"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1819
msgid ""
"Shown to the right of prices only when this field is filled (e.g., \"(tax "
"included)\")."
msgstr ""
"このフィールドが入力されている場合にのみ、価格の右側に表示されます（例："
"「（税込）」）。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1832
msgid "Pre-holidays and special dates (lodging plan prices)"
msgstr "休前日・特定日（宿泊プランの料金）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1835
msgid "Days of the week treated as pre-holidays"
msgstr "休前日とする曜日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1851
msgid ""
"Nights that start on the selected days of the week are priced as pre-"
"holidays. A night before a public holiday is always a pre-holiday, whatever "
"the day of the week."
msgstr ""
"選んだ曜日にチェックインする泊は、休前日の料金になります。祝日の前日の泊は、"
"曜日に関係なく休前日の料金になります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1855
msgid "Special dates"
msgstr "特定日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1866
msgid "+ Add period"
msgstr "+ 期間を追加"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1882
msgid ""
"Nights that start on a day in the period, including the end date, are priced "
"as special dates. If the special date price of a plan is empty, the night is "
"priced as a pre-holiday or a weekday instead."
msgstr ""
"期間内（終了日を含む）の日にチェックインする泊は、特定日の料金になります。プ"
"ランの特定日の料金が空欄の場合、その泊は休前日または平日の料金で計算します。"

#. translators: %s: link to the service menu list.
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1889
msgid ""
"Set the regular, pre-holiday, and special date prices of each plan on the "
"edit screen of each %s."
msgstr "平日・休前日・特定日の料金は、プランごとに%sの編集画面で設定します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1890
msgid "service menu"
msgstr "サービスメニュー"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1911
msgid "Latest check-in time (lodging plans)"
msgstr "最終チェックイン時刻（宿泊プラン）"

#. translators: %s: field name such as "Check-in time".
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1919
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2014
msgid "%s (hour)"
msgstr "%s（時）"

#. translators: %s: field name such as "Check-in time".
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1919
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1933
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1713
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1937
msgid "Latest check-in time"
msgstr "最終チェックイン時刻"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1923
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2021
msgid "Do not set"
msgstr "設定しない"

#. translators: %s: field name such as "Check-in time".
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1933
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2016
msgid "%s (minute)"
msgstr "%s（分）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1942
msgid ""
"On the booking screen, the estimated check-in time can be chosen every 30 "
"minutes from the check-in time of each plan up to this time."
msgstr ""
"予約画面のチェックイン予定時刻は、各プランのチェックイン時刻からこの時刻ま"
"で、30 分おきに選べます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1943
msgid ""
"If the latest check-in time is set on the edit screen of a plan, that "
"setting takes priority."
msgstr ""
"プランの編集画面で最終チェックイン時刻を設定している場合は、そちらが優先され"
"ます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1944
msgid "If neither is set, times up to 23:30 can be chosen."
msgstr "どちらも設定しない場合は 23:30 まで選べます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1952
msgid "Reservation slot time"
msgstr "予約スロットの時間"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1959
msgid "10 minutes"
msgstr "10分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1960
msgid "15 minutes"
msgstr "15分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1961
msgid "20 minutes"
msgstr "20分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1962
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1963
msgid "60 minutes"
msgstr "60分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1966
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1988
msgid "This setting applies only to time slot plans."
msgstr "この設定は時間枠のプランにだけ効きます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1966
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1988
msgid " It is not used for lodging plans."
msgstr "泊のプランには使いません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1973
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:452
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:919
msgid "Post-service buffer"
msgstr "サービス後バッファ"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1984
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:909
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:921
msgid "minutes"
msgstr "分"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1985
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:809
msgid ""
"During the service time plus the buffer time, new reservations will not be "
"accepted."
msgstr "サービス時間＋バッファ時間の間は新規予約を受け付けません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1986
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2008
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2031
msgid "If there is an input for each service menu, that will take priority."
msgstr "各サービスメニューで入力がある場合はそちらが優先されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:1995
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:564
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:451
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:913
msgid "Reservation deadline"
msgstr "予約締切"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2006
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:567
#: src/post-types/class-service-menu-post-type.php:915
msgid "hours ago"
msgstr "時間前"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2015
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:586
msgid "Max advance booking period"
msgstr "予約可能な最大日数"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2026
#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:3576
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:589
msgid "days"
msgstr "日"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2028
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:591
msgid ""
"The maximum number of days in advance that reservations can be made. Set to "
"0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"本日から何日先までの予約を受付可能かを指定する事ができます。0の場合は無制限"
"（シフト登録のある日時）となります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2038
msgid "Maximum upcoming reservations per customer"
msgstr "お客様1人あたりの予約数の上限"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2049
msgctxt "unit of reservation count"
msgid "reservations"
msgstr "件"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2051
msgid ""
"The number of upcoming reservations a single customer can hold at the same "
"time."
msgstr "お客様1人が同時に入れておける、これから先の予約の数です。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2052
msgid ""
"A customer who has reached the limit cannot make a new reservation until one "
"of their reservations ends or is cancelled."
msgstr ""
"上限に達したお客様は、予約が終わるかキャンセルするまで新しい予約ができませ"
"ん。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2053
msgid "Set to 0 for no limit."
msgstr "0 にすると上限なしになります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2056
msgid ""
"Reservations whose date and time have passed, cancelled reservations, and no-"
"show reservations are not counted."
msgstr "日時が過ぎた予約・キャンセル済み・無断キャンセルの予約は数えません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2057
msgid "A reservation for multiple people or multiple nights counts as one."
msgstr "複数人分や連泊の予約も1件と数えます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2060
msgid "Pending reservations are also counted."
msgstr "承認待ちの予約も数えます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2061
msgid ""
"Reservations that the store makes on behalf of customers are not stopped by "
"this limit."
msgstr "店舗が代理で入れる予約は上限で止めません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2068
msgid "Reservation acceptance method"
msgstr "予約の受付方法"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2076
msgid "Members only (only logged-in customers can make reservations)"
msgstr "会員のみ（ログインしたお客様だけが予約できます）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2079
msgid ""
"Guests only (customers can make reservations without registering as a user)"
msgstr "ゲストのみ（ユーザー登録なしで予約できます）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2082
msgid "Members or guests (customers choose on the reservation screen)"
msgstr "会員・ゲストのどちらでも（お客様が予約画面で選びます）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2086
msgid ""
"Choose whether customers can make reservations without registering as a user."
msgstr "ユーザー登録なしで予約できるようにするかを選びます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2089
msgid ""
"A guest reservation is accepted when the customer opens the link in the "
"confirmation email."
msgstr "ゲストの予約は、お客様が確認メールのリンクを開いた時点で受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2090
msgid ""
"If \"Reservation status\" is set to \"Make a tentative reservation\", it is "
"received as a tentative reservation."
msgstr ""
"「予約ステータス」が「仮予約にする」の場合は、仮予約として受け付けます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2093
msgid ""
"The cancellation deadline follows the \"Reservation cancellation\" setting."
msgstr "キャンセルの期限は「予約キャンセル」の設定に従います。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2099
#: src/integrations/google-calendar/class-google-calendar-settings-panel.php:395
msgid "Customer phone number"
msgstr "お客様の電話番号"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2103
msgid "Require a phone number"
msgstr "必須にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2105
msgid ""
"When unchecked, customers can submit the user registration form, the profile "
"editing form, and the customer information fields for guest reservations "
"without entering a phone number."
msgstr ""
"チェックを外すと、新規登録・プロフィール編集・ゲスト予約のお客様情報欄で、電"
"話番号を入力しなくても送信できます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2108
msgid ""
"The phone number is used to contact customers when email does not reach them "
"and to match customer flags. Uncheck this for services that never contact "
"customers by phone, such as online seminars."
msgstr ""
"電話番号は、メールが届かないときの連絡先と、顧客フラグの照合に使います。オン"
"ラインセミナーなど電話で連絡しない業態ではチェックを外してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2115
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:709
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1639
#: src/bookings/class-booking-admin.php:1936
msgid "Reservation status"
msgstr "予約ステータス"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2123
msgid "Instant confirmation"
msgstr "即時確定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2126
msgid "Make a tentative reservation"
msgstr "仮予約にする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2130
msgid ""
"With tentative reservations, reservations are received as \"Tentative\". "
"Change the status to \"Confirmed\" in the reservation list to confirm them."
msgstr ""
"仮予約にすると、予約は「仮予約」で届きます。予約一覧でステータスを「確定」に"
"変更すると確定になります。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2131
msgid ""
"For tentative reservations, a reservation confirmation email will be sent to "
"the user even when the reservation is changed to confirmed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約の場合、確定に変更された時点でもユーザーに予約確定メールが送信されま"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2132
msgid ""
"*Reservations made by users with administrator privileges and salon "
"privileges will be confirmed immediately."
msgstr ""
"※ 管理者権限及びサロン側の権限を持つユーザーによる予約の場合は即時確定になり"
"ます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2140
#: src/multilingual/class-multilingual-settings-panel.php:196
#: src/multilingual/class-multilingual-settings-panel.php:411
msgid "Guidance text for tentative reservation completion"
msgstr "仮予約完了時の案内文"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2149
msgid ""
"This text is displayed below the heading \"Your tentative reservation has "
"been received.\" on the screen shown after a tentative reservation is "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"仮予約が完了した画面で、見出し「仮予約を受け付けました」の下に表示する文章で"
"す。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2150
msgid ""
"You can rewrite it to match how your store operates, such as when you will "
"confirm the reservation (for example, \"We will contact you within 24 hours."
"\") and how you will contact the customer."
msgstr ""
"予約を確定するまでの目安（例: 24時間以内にご連絡します）や連絡方法など、お店"
"の運用に合わせて書き換えられます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2151
msgid "If left blank, the standard text below is displayed."
msgstr "空欄のときは、下記の標準の文章が表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2152
msgid "HTML tags cannot be used, and line breaks are displayed as entered."
msgstr "HTML タグは使えません。改行は入力したとおりに表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2153
msgid "The text of emails does not change."
msgstr "メールの文面は変わりません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2156
msgid "Standard text:"
msgstr "標準の文章:"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2165
msgid "Reservation cancellation"
msgstr "予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2169
msgid "Cancellation of reservations via the web by users"
msgstr "ユーザーによるウェブからの予約キャンセル"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2176
msgid "time specification"
msgstr "時間指定"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2179
msgid "Cannot be canceled"
msgstr "キャンセル不可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2197
msgid "until the hour"
msgstr "時間前まで"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2203
msgid "Duplicate reservations for the same staff"
msgstr "同一スタッフの予約重複"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2213
msgid "Permitted only if specified from the management screen"
msgstr "管理画面からの指定の場合に限り許可"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2216
msgid ""
"Duplicate reservations for the same staff member in the same time slot will "
"only be permitted if manually specified by the staff member from the "
"management screen."
msgstr ""
"同一スタッフの同じ時間帯での重複予約について、管理画面からスタッフによる手動"
"指定の場合に限って許可します。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2222
msgid "Name field for the person receiving the service"
msgstr "ご利用になる方のお名前の欄"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2225
msgid "Do not use"
msgstr "使用しない"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2226
msgid "Use (optional)"
msgstr "使用する（入力は任意）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2227
msgid "Use (required)"
msgstr "使用する（入力を必須にする）"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2229
msgid ""
"Use this when the person making the booking differs from the person or "
"animal receiving the service, such as a parent booking for a child or an "
"owner booking for a pet."
msgstr ""
"保護者がお子さまの予約を入れる、飼い主がペットの予約を入れるなど、予約する人"
"とサービスを受ける人・動物が違う場合に使います。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2230
msgid ""
"When enabled, a name field appears on the booking confirmation screen. The "
"entered name also appears in notification emails, booking editing, and "
"booking lists."
msgstr ""
"使用すると、予約内容の確認画面にお名前の入力欄が表示されます。入力されたお名"
"前は、通知メール・予約の編集画面・予約一覧にも表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2231
msgid "Field heading"
msgstr "入力欄の見出し"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2232
#: src/common/class-attendee-name.php:42
#: src/blocks/reservation/booking-confirm-app.js:205
msgid "Name of the person receiving the service"
msgstr "ご利用になる方のお名前"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2234
msgid "This cannot be changed while “Do not use” is selected."
msgstr "「使用しない」のときは変更できません。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2235
msgid ""
"You can change the heading to match your industry (for example, Name of the "
"child receiving care or Pet name)."
msgstr ""
"業種に合わせて見出しを変えられます（例: 受診されるお子さまのお名前、ペットの"
"お名前）。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2236
msgid "If left blank, “Name of the person receiving the service” is displayed."
msgstr "空欄の場合は「ご利用になる方のお名前」と表示されます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2241
msgid "Saved list"
msgstr "名簿"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2243
msgid "Allow members and staff to manage a saved list"
msgstr "会員とスタッフが名簿を管理できるようにする"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2247
msgid ""
"The name field is not shown on the booking screen, so the saved list cannot "
"be selected. Change <a href=\"#vkbm-booking-attendee-name-mode\">Name field</"
"a> to “Use (optional)” or “Use (required)”."
msgstr ""
"予約画面に名前欄が表示されていないため、登録名簿を選択できません。<a "
"href=\"#vkbm-booking-attendee-name-mode\">名前欄</a>を「使う（入力は任意）」"
"または「使う（入力は必須）」に変更してください。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2249
msgid "Name of the list"
msgstr "名簿の呼び方"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2250
msgid "Used for the My Page heading and booking screen choices."
msgstr "マイページの見出しと予約画面の選択肢に使われます。"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2251
msgid "Show “Yourself” as a choice on the booking screen"
msgstr "予約画面の選択肢に「ご本人」を表示する"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2252
msgid "Use a furigana field"
msgstr "ふりがな欄を使う"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2253
msgid "Furigana field heading"
msgstr "ふりがな欄の見出し"

#: src/admin/class-provider-settings-page.php:2253
#: src/admin/class-user-profile-fields.php:102
#: src/attendees/class-attendee-roster-user-profile.php:105
#: src/attendees/class-attendee-roster-user-profile.php:125
#: src/attendees/class-attendee-roster-user-profile.php:150
#: src/auth/class-auth-shortcodes.php:1115
