"には、料金区分を1件以上入力してください。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1499
msgid "The price unit is \"Per tour\", so the price categories were deleted."
msgstr "料金の単位が「1ツアーあたり」のため、料金区分を削除しました。"

#. translators: %d: maximum number of guests per room (the number of guests included in the basic price was reduced to this value).
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1546
msgid ""
"The number of guests included in the basic price exceeded the maximum guests "
"per room, so it was reduced to %d."
msgstr ""
"基本料金に含まれる人数が1室の最大人数を超えていたため、%d人に変更しました。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1589
msgid ""
"Enter a valid event date and save again. The previous service period was "
"kept."
msgstr ""
"有効な開催日を入力して、もう一度保存してください。提供期間は前回の設定のまま"
"です。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1596
msgid ""
"The start of the service period was later than its end, so the service "
"period was saved with its previous values."
msgstr ""
"提供期間の開始日が終了日より後だったため、提供期間は前回の内容のまま保存しま"
"した。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1597
msgid "Check the dates and save again."
msgstr "日付を確認して、もう一度保存してください。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1685
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1688
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1904
