#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1696
msgid "Nights"
msgstr "泊"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1700
msgid ""
"If you choose \"Nights\", bookings are accepted by check-in date and check-"
"out date."
msgstr "「泊」を選ぶと、チェックイン日とチェックアウト日で予約を受け付けます。"

