msgid ""
"If you choose \"Nights\", the time required, post-service buffer, and fixed "
"start times fields are not used, so they are hidden."
msgstr ""
"「泊」を選ぶと、所要時間・サービス後バッファ・固定開始時刻の欄は使わないため"
"非表示になります。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1707
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1709
