msgstr "/ 1ツアー"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1743
msgid "/ 1 guest"
msgstr "/ 1名"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1767
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1770
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1853
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1856
msgid "Price unit"
msgstr "料金の単位"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1773
msgid "Per guest"
msgstr "1名あたり"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1778
msgid "Per tour"
msgstr "1ツアーあたり"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1782
msgid ""
"If you choose \"Per tour\", the basic price is the price of one tour "
"regardless of the number of guests."
msgstr ""
"「1ツアーあたり」を選ぶと、人数にかかわらず基本料金が1ツアーの料金になりま"
