#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1783
msgid ""
"If you choose \"Per tour\" and save, private booking is turned on "
"automatically, and the private booking by customer settings are deleted."
msgstr ""
"「1ツアーあたり」を選んで保存すると、貸し切り予約が自動で有効になり、予約者が"
"選ぶ貸切の設定は削除されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1788
msgid ""
"Price categories can be used with \"Per tour\" only when the additional fee "
"for exceeding the specified number is enabled."
msgstr ""
"「1ツアーあたり」で料金区分を使えるのは、規定人数を超える場合の追加料金を有効"
"にしたときだけです。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1789
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1870
msgid ""
"If it is not enabled, price categories you have already set are deleted when "
"you save."
msgstr "追加料金を使わない場合、すでに設定した料金区分は保存時に削除されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1798
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1876
