"An additional fee applies, depending on the number of guests, when the "
"specified number is exceeded"
msgstr "規定人数を超える場合は人数に応じて追加料金あり"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1801
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1879
msgid "Guests included in the basic price"
msgstr "基本料金に含まれる人数"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1804
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1882
msgid "guests or fewer"
msgstr "人まで"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1807
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1885
msgid ""
"Enter the specified number of guests (the number included in the basic "
"price) as 1 or more."
msgstr "規定人数（基本料金に含める人数）を 1 以上で入力してください。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1808
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1886
msgid "Set the basic price in the \"Basic price\" field below."
msgstr "基本料金は下の「基本料金」欄で設定します。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1809
msgid "Values above the maximum guests per tour are reduced to that maximum."
msgstr "1ツアーの最大人数を超える値は、最大人数に変更されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1826
msgid "/ per room, per night"
msgstr "/ 1室・1泊"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1829
msgid "/ per guest, per night"
msgstr "/ 1名・1泊"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1859
msgid "Per guest, per night"
msgstr "1名1泊あたり"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1864
msgid "Per room, per night"
msgstr "1室1泊あたり"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1868
msgid ""
"If you choose \"Per room, per night\", enter the price of one room per night "
"as the basic price. It is not multiplied by the number of guests."
msgstr ""
"「1室1泊あたり」を選ぶと、基本料金に1室1泊の料金を入力します。人数は掛かりま"
"せん。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1869
msgid ""
"Price categories can be used with \"Per room, per night\" only when the "
"additional fee for exceeding the specified number is enabled."
msgstr ""
"「1室1泊あたり」では、規定人数を超える場合の追加料金を使うときだけ、料金区分"
"を使えます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1871
msgid ""
"When you switch between \"Per room, per night\" with the additional fee and "
"\"Per guest, per night\", review the amounts in the price categories."
msgstr ""
"「1室1泊あたり（追加料金あり）」と「1名1泊あたり」を切り替えたときは、料金区"
"分の金額を見直してください。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1887
msgid "Values above the maximum guests per room are reduced to that maximum."
msgstr "1室の最大人数より大きい値は、最大人数に合わせて保存されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1907
msgid ""
"This menu is saved with the \"Nights\" booking unit. Because the industry "
"preset is not \"Lodging\", it is currently handled as a time-slot menu."
msgstr ""
"このメニューは「泊」単位で保存されています。業種プリセットが「宿泊」以外のた"
