#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1908
msgid ""
"To switch back to \"Lodging\", change the industry preset to \"Lodging\" at "
"the link below."
msgstr ""
"宿泊に戻すには、次のリンク先で業種プリセットを「宿泊」に変更してください。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1909
msgid "Industry preset on the General Settings page"
msgstr "基本設定ページの業種プリセット"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:1929
