msgid "Reservation slot time on the General Settings page"
msgstr "基本設定画面の予約スロットの時間"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2089
msgid "If set, only the specified times are available for booking."
msgstr "設定すると、指定した時刻のみ予約可能になります。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2118
#: src/blocks/reservation/booking-confirm-app.js:3223
msgid "Private booking"
msgstr "貸し切り予約"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2122
msgid "Make the slot private once a booking is placed"
msgstr "予約が入ったらその時間帯を貸し切りにする"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2125
msgid ""
"When enabled, once even a single booking is placed in a time slot, other "
"users can no longer book that slot even if seats remain."
msgstr ""
"ONにすると、1件でも予約が入った時間帯は残り枠があっても他のユーザーは予約でき"
"なくなります。"

