msgid "Only the first person to book the same date and time can choose this."
msgstr "※同じ日時で最初の予約者のみ指定できます"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2188
msgid ""
"This setting cannot be used together with \"Private booking\" for this menu."
msgstr "このメニューの「貸し切り予約」と同時には使えません。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2189
msgid "While \"Private booking\" is on, this setting is ignored."
msgstr "「貸し切り予約」がONの間、この設定は無視されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2194
#: src/blocks/reservation/app.js:2506 src/blocks/reservation/app.js:5234
#: src/blocks/reservation/booking-confirm-app.js:3200
msgid "Private booking fee"
msgstr "貸切料金"

