msgid ""
"Define categories such as \"Adult\" and \"Child\", each with its own price."
msgstr "「大人」「子供」などの区分を、それぞれの料金とともに定義します。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2503
msgid ""
"When one or more categories are defined, the basic price is ignored and the "
"price is calculated from the categories."
msgstr "区分を1つ以上定義すると、基本料金は無視されて区分料金で計算されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2504
msgid ""
"If no category is defined, the basic price multiplied by the number of "
"guests is used."
msgstr "区分を定義しない場合は、基本料金×人数で計算されます。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2505
msgid ""
"Enter the fee added for each guest over the number included in the basic "
"price, per night."
msgstr ""
"基本料金に含まれる人数を超えた1名ごとに、1泊あたりで加算する金額を入力してく"
