#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2506
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2509
msgid ""
"Guests in the highest-priced categories are included in the basic price "
"first, and the remaining guests are charged."
msgstr ""
"金額の高い区分の人から順に基本料金に含め、残りの人に追加料金がかかります。"

#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2508
msgid ""
"Enter the fee added for each guest over the number included in the basic "
"price."
msgstr "基本料金に含まれる人数を超えた1名ごとに加算する金額を入力します。"

#. translators: %s: resource label (plural), e.g. "Staff".
#: src/admin/class-service-menu-editor.php:2590
