#: src/integrations/google-calendar/class-google-calendar-settings-panel.php:437
msgid ""
" Items related to the customer (name, phone number, email address, and "
"notes) are off by default because Google Calendar may be seen by more people "
"than the reservation management screen (sharing, phone notifications, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Googleカレンダーは共有やスマホ通知などで予約管理画面より多くの人の目に触れる"
"可能性があるため、お客様に関する項目（氏名・電話番号・メールアドレス・メモ）"
"は初期状態でオフです。"

#: src/integrations/google-calendar/class-google-calendar-settings-panel.php:453
