msgstr "連携を解除しますか？"

#: src/integrations/google-calendar/class-google-calendar-settings-panel.php:454
msgid ""
"After it is removed, new bookings will no longer be reflected in the "
"calendar."
msgstr "解除後、新しい予約はカレンダーに反映されなくなります。"

#: src/integrations/google-calendar/class-google-calendar-settings-panel.php:455
msgid "Events already created in Google will remain."
msgstr "Google側に作成済みの予定は残ります。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:97
msgid "Booking from an external calendar"
msgstr "外部カレンダーからの予約"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:114
msgid "External booking"
msgstr "外部予約"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:136
msgid ""
"This booking was imported from an external calendar. The external calendar "
"takes priority. If you change the dates, the room, or the status while the "
"event remains on the external calendar, it returns to the external content "
"at the next fetch (about every 30 minutes)."
msgstr ""
"この予約は外部カレンダーから取り込まれました。外部カレンダーの内容が優先さ"
"れ、日程・客室・ステータスを変えても、外部に同じ予定が残っていれば次の取得"
"（約30分ごと）で元に戻ります。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:138
msgid "Imported from:"
msgstr "取り込み元:"

#. translators: %s: Date and time of the last update from the external calendar.
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:149
msgid "Last updated from the external calendar: %s"
msgstr "外部カレンダーからの最終更新: %s"

#. translators: %s: Date and time when the booking was restored to the external calendar content.
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:160
msgid "Restored to the external calendar content at the fetch at %s."
msgstr "%s の取得で外部カレンダーの内容に戻しました。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:184
msgid "Bookings on this site"
msgstr "このサイトの予約"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-booking-display.php:185
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:512
msgid "External calendar"
msgstr "外部カレンダー"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:158
msgid "Import external calendar"
msgstr "外部カレンダーの取り込み"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:185
msgid "Could not fetch the calendar. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーを取得できませんでした。ページを再読み込みして、もう一度お試しくだ"
"さい。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:188
msgid ""
"Enter the iCal calendar URL of an external booking site such as Booking.com. "
"The calendar is fetched about every 30 minutes, and the dates already booked "
"on that site become unavailable for this room."
msgstr ""
"Booking.com などの外部の予約サイトのカレンダーの URL（iCal 形式）を入力する"
"と、約30分ごとに自動で取得し、外部で予約が入っている期間をこの客室の予約不可"
"にします。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:189
msgid "Do not share this URL with anyone else."
msgstr "この URL は他の人に教えないでください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:195
msgid "Calendar URL (iCal format)"
msgstr "カレンダーの URL（iCal 形式）"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:209
msgid ""
"Copy the iCal calendar URL from the booking site, paste it here, and save "
"the room. The calendar is fetched right after saving."
msgstr ""
"外部の予約サイトで iCal 形式のカレンダーの URL をコピーし、ここに貼り付けて客"
"室を保存してください。保存するとすぐに取得します。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:210
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:230
msgid ""
"The save button is \"Update\". For a new or draft room, it is \"Publish\" or "
"\"Save draft\"."
msgstr ""
"保存ボタンは「更新」です。新規・下書きの客室では「公開」または「下書き保存」"
"です。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:211
msgid "The automatic fetch runs only while the room is published."
msgstr "自動取得は、客室が公開されている間だけ動きます。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:212
msgid ""
"Only URLs starting with https are accepted. To stop importing, clear this "
"field and save."
msgstr ""
"https から始まる URL だけ使えます。取り込みをやめるときは、この欄を空にして保"
"存してください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:223
msgid "Fetch now"
msgstr "今すぐ取得"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:229
msgid "Enter the calendar URL and save the room to start importing."
msgstr "カレンダーの URL を入力して客室を保存すると、取り込みを始めます。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:233
msgid "The URL has been changed. Save the room to fetch the calendar."
msgstr "URL を変更しています。客室を保存すると、カレンダーを取得します。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:236
msgid ""
"The URL field is empty. Save the room to stop importing. Bookings already "
"imported are kept, so cancel them by hand if they are no longer needed."
msgstr ""
"URL の欄が空です。客室を保存すると、取り込みをやめます。取り込み済みの予約は"
"残るので、不要な場合は手でキャンセルしてください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:259
msgid "Import status"
msgstr "取り込みの状態"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:263
msgid "Last fetch"
msgstr "最終取得"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:265
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:273
msgid "Not fetched yet"
msgstr "まだ取得していません"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:267
msgid "If the site gets few visits, the automatic fetch may be delayed."
msgstr "サイトへのアクセスが少ないと、自動取得が遅れることがあります。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:272
msgid "Last successful fetch"
msgstr "最後に成功した取得"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:287
msgid "Note"
msgstr "お知らせ"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:361
msgid ""
"The calendar URL could not be saved. Enter an iCal calendar URL that starts "
"with https."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーの URL を保存できませんでした。https から始まる iCal 形式の URL を"
"入力してください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:416
msgid "You do not have permission to fetch this calendar."
msgstr "このカレンダーを取得する権限がありません。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:423
msgid "Save the calendar URL first, then press \"Fetch now\"."
msgstr "先にカレンダーの URL を保存してから、「今すぐ取得」を押してください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:433
msgid ""
"The calendar was fetched a moment ago. Wait a few seconds and try again."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーをさきほど取得したばかりです。数秒待ってから、もう一度お試しくださ"
"い。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:443
msgid ""
"The calendar is already being fetched. Wait a few seconds and reload the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーを取得中です。数秒待ってから、ページを再読み込みしてください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:463
msgid "Fetched the calendar. No bookings were changed."
msgstr "カレンダーを取得しました。予約の変更はありませんでした。"

#. translators: 1: Number of bookings added, 2: Number of bookings updated, 3: Number of bookings cancelled.
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:468
msgid "Fetched the calendar. %1$d added, %2$d updated, %3$d cancelled."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーを取得しました。追加 %1$d 件・更新 %2$d 件・キャンセル %3$d 件を反"
"映しました。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:590
msgid ""
"The external calendar could not be fetched several times in a row (about 90 "
"minutes or more). Rooms may be booked on the booking site without being "
"blocked here. Open the room below and check the calendar URL."
msgstr ""
"外部カレンダーを連続して取得できていません（約90分以上）。外部の予約サイトで"
"予約が入っても、こちらで予約不可にならない可能性があります。下の客室を開い"
"て、カレンダーの URL を確認してください。"

#. translators: %d: Number of rooms that are not listed above.
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-admin.php:602
msgid "%d more room is not listed."
msgid_plural "%d more rooms are not listed."
msgstr[0] "ほか %d 室は表示していません。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-cron.php:65
msgid "Every 30 Minutes"
msgstr "30分ごと"

#. translators: %d: Number of recurring events that were not imported.
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-importer.php:336
msgid ""
"%d recurring event was not imported because recurring events are not "
"supported. Register the dates as individual events on the booking site."
msgid_plural ""
"%d recurring events were not imported because recurring events are not "
"supported. Register the dates as individual events on the booking site."
msgstr[0] ""
"繰り返し予定は取り込めないため、%d 件を取り込みませんでした。外部の予約サイト"
"で、日付ごとの予定として登録してください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:197
msgid "Waiting for the first fetch"
msgstr "初回の取得待ち"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:199
msgid "Fetched"
msgstr "取得済み"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:201
msgid "Fetch error"
msgstr "取得エラー"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:216
msgid ""
"The calendar URL is incorrect, or it is no longer valid on the booking site. "
"Copy the iCal calendar URL from the booking site again and enter it here."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーの URL が正しくないか、外部の予約サイトで無効になっています。外部の"
"予約サイトで iCal 形式のカレンダーの URL をコピーし直して、ここに入力してくだ"
"さい。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:218
msgid ""
"Could not connect to the booking site. Wait a while and press \"Fetch now\". "
"If the error continues, check that the calendar URL is correct."
msgstr ""
"外部の予約サイトに接続できませんでした。しばらく待ってから「今すぐ取得」を押"
"してください。エラーが続く場合は、カレンダーの URL が正しいか確認してくださ"
"い。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:220
msgid ""
"The fetched content is not an iCal calendar. Copy the iCal calendar URL from "
"the booking site again and enter it here."
msgstr ""
"取得した内容が iCal 形式のカレンダーではありませんでした。外部の予約サイトで "
"iCal 形式のカレンダーの URL をコピーし直して、ここに入力してください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:222
msgid ""
"The calendar data is too large to read (the limit is 1MB). Check that the "
"URL is an iCal calendar URL for this room only."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーのデータが大きすぎて読み取れませんでした（上限は1MBです）。この客室"
"だけの iCal 形式のカレンダーの URL か確認してください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:224
msgid ""
"The calendar has too many events (more than 1,000) to import. Remove old "
"events on the booking site, or check that the URL is for this room only."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーの予定が多すぎる（1,000件を超えている）ため取り込めませんでした。外"
"部の予約サイトで古い予定を整理するか、この客室だけの URL か確認してください。"

#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-external-calendar-status.php:226
msgid ""
"Something went wrong while importing the calendar. Press \"Fetch now\" "
"again. If the error continues, contact the site administrator."
msgstr ""
"カレンダーの取り込み中に問題が起きました。もう一度「今すぐ取得」を押してくだ"
"さい。エラーが続く場合は、サイトの管理者に連絡してください。"

#. translators: 1: room name, 2: check-in date, 3: check-out date
#: src/integrations/ical-import/class-ical-import-sync.php:264
msgid "External calendar / %1$s / %2$s - %3$s"
msgstr "外部カレンダー / %1$s / %2$s〜%3$s"

#: src/multilingual/class-multilingual-settings-panel.php:273
msgid ""
"Register the terms shown on pages in languages other than the site language, "
"such as English, for each language."
