#: src/multilingual/class-multilingual-settings-panel.php:413
msgid ""
"To edit the tentative reservation completion guidance in the basic settings, "
"set \"Reservation status\" to \"Make a tentative reservation\"."
msgstr ""
"基本設定で仮予約完了時の案内文を編集するには、「予約ステータス」を「仮予約に"
