#. translators: 1: Label of the "Other conditions" field. 2: Link to the "Multilingual settings" tab.
#: src/multilingual/class-service-menu-multilingual-meta-box.php:121
msgid ""
"Enter the title, excerpt, and %1$s shown on pages in the languages added in "
